  "captions": [
    {
      "start": 0.22,
      "end": 3.98,
      "text": "Every selfie you post hides\na reflection.",
      "beat": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.98,
      "end": 7.345,
      "text": "Now AI can step inside your eye\nand look around.",
      "beat": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 7.505,
      "end": 13.185,
      "text": "Across healthy adults, the human cornea\ncurves like a 7.8 mm dome,",
      "beat": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 13.185,
      "end": 15.821,
      "text": "acting as a tiny wide-angle\nsecurity mirror.",
      "beat": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 15.981,
      "end": 20.141,
      "text": "At the University of Maryland,\nresearchers fed portrait clips",
      "beat": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 20.141,
      "end": 22.481,
      "text": "into a 3D neural radiance field.",
      "beat": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 22.641,
      "end": 27.651,
      "text": "Previously, two things blocked this:\nmicro-shifts as eyeballs rotate,",
      "beat": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 27.651,
      "end": 31.239,
      "text": "and your colored iris overpowering\nfaint room reflections.",
      "beat": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 31.399,
      "end": 35.159,
      "text": "Their algorithm locks onto cornea pose\nwhile peeling away",
      "beat": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 35.159,
      "end": 37.272,
      "text": "a 2D map of your iris texture.",
      "beat": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 37.432,
      "end": 42.302,
      "text": "Suddenly, hidden rooms, plush toys,\nand bystanders appear in 3D,",
      "beat": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 42.302,
      "end": 44.793,
      "text": "given enough head motion.",
      "beat": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 44.953,
      "end": 49.165,
      "text": "Then they tested public music videos\nof Miley Cyrus and Lady Gaga...",
      "beat": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 49.805,
      "end": 54.185,
      "text": "Zooming into single eyes, phantom\nsilhouettes of studio lights",
      "beat": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 54.185,
      "end": 56.855,
      "text": "and camera crews emerged years later.",
      "beat": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 56.855,
      "end": 57.436,
      "text": "Remember...",
      "beat": 8
    }
  ]
